From a0f53b6ef32fb0d1ff1502e460d4185f13826e24 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mir Mohammad Sajedul Islam <mohammad.sajedul.islam@g.bracu.ac.bd>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 17:13:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(sim): add four playable simulations to the landing page

- Projectile Motion: target-practice game on Earth, Moon and Mars
- Bohr Atom: hydrogen energy levels, real spectral lines, 4 challenges
- Molecule Shapes: rotating 3D VSEPR models with explore and quiz modes
- pH Scale: guess-the-pH game with hydrogen-ion concentration
- Launch each from its card in an accessible modal; games load on demand
- Pure simulation maths in lib/sim*.ts
